ETM Demo - Installation Steps:
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y python3 python3-pip git
git clone https://github.com/ameyaarista/velo_etm_testing.git
cd velo_etm_testing
pip3 install flask flask-cors dnspython requests pandas urllib3 tabulate --break-system-packages
sudo ufw allow 8080
python3 server.py

